+# SM-T510 private networking: no eBPF programs/maps are claimed to be loaded.
+# This file is selected only by the gta3xlwifi legacy_networking build variable.
+# The immutable runtime flag is checked again by netd1shot and the actual daemon.
+# netd1shot retains its critical reboot_on_failure behavior from stock netd.rc.
+# It verifies the genuine held kernel/producer/tagging/resolver path, then closes
+# its owner lease with the traffic barrier still held. It never releases policy.
+on load-bpf-programs
+    exec_start netd1shot
+    start netd
